    "canonical_ref": "Mal.1.11",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "For from the rising of the sun even to its going down, my name is great among the nations, and in every place incense will be offered to my name, and a pure offering; for my name is great among the nations,” says the LORD of Armies.",
